2. The integration target

The one core flow should become:

User types or edits something
  -> Convex saves the note/cell/block
  -> edit event enters Noteworthiness Outbox
  -> cheap scanner decides whether it matters
  -> if meaningful: entity/facet work item is created
  -> cache/OKF/retrieval checks prevent duplicate work
  -> Linkup/Firecrawl/internal context runs only if needed
  -> agent writes evidence-backed outputs through managed tools
  -> OKF/backlinks/coach cues update the room

This directly extends the professional workflow contract in the pasted eval text: chat note / file upload / selected artifact / mixed room state should flow into intent + entity extraction, evidence plan, artifact refs, evidence-bearing CellPayload/wiki writes, lock/CAS/draft/no-clobber, and trace/eval result.

3. New layer to add: Room Activity Outbox

Do not call the agent on every keystroke. Add a generic outbox that records committed semantic edit events, not raw typing.

New table
roomActivityOutbox: defineTable({
  roomId: v.id("rooms"),

  sourceKind: v.union(
    v.literal("node"),
    v.literal("artifact_element"),
    v.literal("message"),
    v.literal("wiki_revision")
  ),

  sourceId: v.string(),
  sourceVersion: v.number(),
  sourceHash: v.string(),

  actor: actorV,
  visibility: visibilityV,
  ownerId: v.optional(v.string()),

  eventKind: v.union(
    v.literal("content_committed"),
    v.literal("idle_after_typing"),
    v.literal("page_hidden"),
    v.literal("manual_save"),
    v.literal("artifact_imported")
  ),

  status: v.union(
    v.literal("queued"),
    v.literal("scanning"),
    v.literal("not_noteworthy"),
    v.literal("noteworthy"),
    v.literal("job_created"),
    v.literal("failed")
  ),

  attempts: v.number(),
  nextRunAt: v.optional(v.number()),
  error: v.optional(v.string()),
  createdAt: v.number(),
  updatedAt: v.number(),
})
.index("by_status_nextRunAt", ["status", "nextRunAt"])
.index("by_room_source", ["roomId", "sourceKind", "sourceId"]);

Why this table matters:

- It decouples typing from agent work.
- It lets the user put the phone away.
- It lets the system retry safely.
- It gives a durable audit path.
- It lets us batch/skip duplicate scans.

This is the same fire-and-forget shape you want: mutation persists user work, action/workflow handles slow intelligence later.

