Component research: what we should use and why

Convex Components are sandboxed mini-backends with their own tables and functions. They cannot read app tables or call app functions unless explicitly wired, which makes them safe to add as infrastructure modules rather than letting them own NodeRoom’s business logic.

1. Durable agent / Agent component

Convex’s Agent component manages agents, threads, messages, tools, and multi-agent workflows; it is designed to separate long-running agent workflows from the UI while preserving live reactivity and persisted message history.

